ip away?</p>", "short_description": "You are the leader of a city-state in high medieval Europe. Expand your city through deep city-building systems, build a trade empire across the known world, and lead men to war to defend trade routes in a high-stakes struggle of global strategy and brutal warfare.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066390/f2e33ad9e7aae16005e1e73d798bed90b0d08bdf/header.jpg?t=1787673306", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066390/3ff42fd6053f4dba079be429600f31c65da52456/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787673306", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066390/3ff42fd6053f4dba079be429600f31c65da52456/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787673306", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 / AMD Radeon RX Vega 56<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 5 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX Vega 64<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": 